    "title": "Chicago Bears Official App",
    "description": "Download the official app of the Chicago Bears and stay connected to the team wherever you are, thanks to features including:\r\n\r\n- Live Activities that give you game updates right on your lock screen (iOS only)\r\n- Bears Stories that enable you to follow the team in a familiar, social media-like layout\r\n- Gameday Guide featuring:\u00a0\r\n- Easy access to your tickets for fast, easy entry to Soldier Field\r\n- Parking information\r\n- Gameday giveaway\r\n- Guide to activities inside and outside Soldier Field\r\n- Concessions menu, including featured chef of the game\r\n- Comprehensive map of Soldier Field\r\n- And much more!\r\n- Live stats and play-by-play updates\r\n- Push notifications for every scoring play\r\n- News: Official team news, roster moves and more\r\n- Video: Highlights, live press conferences, Bears Postgame Live, 1920 Football Drive all-access",
